{"schemaVersion":1,"id":461,"sections":[{"id":"1820001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20597],"start":0,"count":38}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:1","scriptId":20597,"text":"死水——波西娅的研究室。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:2","scriptId":20597,"text":"“嗯，空钢要投入量产果然还是不可行啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:3","scriptId":20597,"text":"死水的技术顾问波西娅把看完的报告撕碎后扔进了垃圾桶。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:4","scriptId":20597,"text":"“姐姐怎么最近感觉有些烦躁？不是已经成功把空钢推向全球市场了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:5","scriptId":20597,"text":"“那只不过是个开始，现在飞行战车兽有点肆虐的趋势，加速制造出的舞装却没有可以使用的人选，真是让人着急。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:6","scriptId":20597,"text":"“哦，人选啊，那确实没很好的办法呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:7","scriptId":20597,"text":"“就和陆地钢舞姬一样，在匹配方面没有特别效率的手段。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:8","scriptId":20597,"text":"“而且空钢的死亡率居高不下，是高风险职业。如果是我也不会愿意成为空钢呢，虽然在空中翱翔应该会很舒服。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:9","scriptId":20597,"text":"“死亡率高这点，已经尽力在增加操作者的生还率了，但被击晕后的坠落大都无法挽救。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:10","scriptId":20597,"text":"“用降落伞呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:11","scriptId":20597,"text":"“迫降用的伞包确实有准备，但有时候打开伞包会被敌人二次攻击，这时候就无能为力了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":735,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:12","scriptId":20597,"text":"“那可真是绝望地体验……我算是理解为什么人员可贵了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:13","scriptId":20597,"text":"“倒也不是，如果进入量产的话，就可以通过抬高报酬进行招募了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:14","scriptId":20597,"text":"“量产的陆战钢舞姬也一般般吧，而且最近才搞出来的不是吗？要空钢立刻就量产，不太可能吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:15","scriptId":20597,"text":"“哟~看你平常不闻不问的，其实还挺关心姐姐的工作嘛~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:16","scriptId":20597,"text":"波西娅随手换了一份报告阅览。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:17","scriptId":20597,"text":"“啊，只是无聊的时候多看了看相关的新闻报导而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:18","scriptId":20597,"text":"“这儿可有不少在新闻上不会报导的消息哟？要看吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:19","scriptId":20597,"text":"波西娅抖了抖手里的报告。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:20","scriptId":20597,"text":"“话题走远了，长官他们不也去指挥空钢了吗？我学习一点空钢的知识也没什么好奇怪的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:21","scriptId":20597,"text":"“量产陆战钢舞姬的强度虽然不如定制舞装，但胜在筛选人员方便、能够提供速成战力，很多国家都大量购入了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:22","scriptId":20597,"text":"“还是姐姐会做生意，量产的概念就你先想到了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:23","scriptId":20597,"text":"“不过空钢就没那么顺利了，本来战斗机的性能就不怎么可靠，光伤亡率吓退了不少人。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:24","scriptId":20597,"text":"“所以还是量产化的陆战钢舞姬更吸引人咯？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:25","scriptId":20597,"text":"“是啊，虽然确实敌不过空中的威胁，但多装载一些对空武器的话，也能从一定程度上减轻空袭压力。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:26","scriptId":20597,"text":"“啊，说起对空武器，维多利亚的防空讲座已经听过了。当时我还操作了一下高射机枪，但感觉根本不合适我……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:27","scriptId":20597,"text":"“纯粹的威吓射击，能命中空中敌人的概率很低，就算练习了，命中率也不会提升多少，总之就是不合算。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:28","scriptId":20597,"text":"“我觉得还不如偷偷研究一下RHO屋……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:29","scriptId":20597,"text":"“那个东西真的很好用吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:30","scriptId":20597,"text":"“那是当然，这个系统如果能无间断运载的话，就根本不需要航空钢舞姬了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:31","scriptId":20597,"text":"“但那样的话，运输机不也不能使用了吗……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:32","scriptId":20597,"text":"“走地勤运输呗。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:33","scriptId":20597,"text":"“那样很慢啊……特别是大陆间的移动，而且陆地也有很多战车兽盘踞的地方，要绕路什么的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:34","scriptId":20597,"text":"“这就没办法了，总比望着天空提心吊胆地过日子要好。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:35","scriptId":20597,"text":"就在这时，空袭警报响起了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:36","scriptId":20597,"text":"“看看，这就来了不是吗？RHO屋今天在蓄能状态，无法开启。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:37","scriptId":20597,"text":"“呃……让空钢出战呗。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1820001-PROLOGUE:20597:38","scriptId":20597,"text":"“是啊，总得想办法解决一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
